WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.073
Step 1. Open the schedule. You can change the name, the valid period,

1.2
00:00:05.073 --> 00:00:08.988
the visibility and the encounter defaults of a template.

1.3
00:00:08.988 --> 00:00:13.752
Select Services, the service, then Schedule under Scheduling.

2.1
00:00:13.752 --> 00:00:18.893
Step 2. Open the template. On the template card, select the pencil icon.

2.2
00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:21.543
The Edit Schedule Template sheet opens,

2.3
00:00:21.543 --> 00:00:26.662
and it also lists the sessions of the template under Availabilities.

3.1
00:00:26.662 --> 00:00:28.819
Step 3. Change the details.

3.2
00:00:28.819 --> 00:00:33.481
Here you rename the template and move the end of the Valid Period.

3.3
00:00:33.481 --> 00:00:38.497
Care refuses a new valid period that leaves out slots that already have

3.4
00:00:38.497 --> 00:00:43.403
appointments.

4.1
00:00:43.403 --> 00:00:45.579
Step 4. Save the changes.

4.2
00:00:45.579 --> 00:00:50.124
Select Save, which is active only after you change a value.

4.3
00:00:50.124 --> 00:00:54.476
Care shows Schedule template updated successfully.
